            "description": "## Request body parameters\n\n| Parameter | Type | Description | Example |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `form_data` | string | Specify the user information for creation of DSR. The value of dsr_report_type can either be: DIGITAL or PHYSICAL | `{\"ticket_type\":[\"access\"],\"email\":\"john.doe@gmail.com\",\"phone\":\"\",\"first_name\":\"test\",\"last_name\":\"Test nondigital\",\"dob\":\"\",\"country\":\"\",\"state\":\"\",\"city\":\"\",\"street\":\"\",\"postal_code\":\"\",\"request_details\":\"\",\"dsr_report_type\":\"DIGITAL\",\"submit\":true}` |\n| `is_user_create_needed` | boolean | Specify if user account to be created in Privacy Central Portal or not | `true` |\n| `form_uuid` | string | Specify the Form UUID | `7f304795-a1d1-47c0-9bed-b15dc1a7d9e7` |\n| `created_date` | integer | Specify the created date | `1754973000000` |\n| `user_timezone` | string | Specify the data subject's time zone. **Note:** If no time zone is provided, Securiti uses UTC as the fallback time zone. | `Africa/Cairo` |\n| `scope_metadata` | object | Defines the search scope for internal DSR automation. This scope applies only to the Microsoft 365 Outlook (Self-Hosted) connector when Smart Search is enabled. It is not supported for external DSR forms or Discovery scans. **Note:** If this feature is not available in your tenant, contact your Customer Success Manager or Account Representative to confirm whether it is included in your plan and whether your tenant meets the eligibility requirements for its activation. | — |\n| `scope_metadata.data_source_scopes.958` | object | Enter the data source id. You can fetch id from the response of Fetches all data sources setup for robotic automation API. | — |\n| `scope_metadata.data_source_scopes.958.keywords` | array of strings | Enter keywords to limit the smart search results to communications relevant to a specific DSR request or investigation context. The search returns only emails that match both the provided keywords and data subject identifiers. | `[\"probation\", \"summers\"]` |\n| `scope_metadata.data_source_scopes.958.users` | array of strings | Enter the mailbox addresses to limit the smart search scope. The search is performed only within the specified mailboxes and returns emails that match the provided keywords and data subject identifiers. | `[\"hr@gmail.com\", \"manager@gmail.com\"]` |"
          },
