y verification process or track your request, please create an account below. Upon successful account creation, you would be proceeded for identity verification.</p>\\\":\\\"<p>For å starte identitetsbekreftelsesprosessen eller spore forespørselen din, vennligst opprett en konto nedenfor. Etter vellykket kontoopprettelse, vil du bli videreført for identitetsbekreftelse.</p>\\\",\\\"Cookie Notice: This form uses a Cross-Site Request Forgery (XSRF) prevention cookie for the purpose of ensuring security. This cookie is strictly necessary and does not collect any personal information from you.\\\":\\\"Cookie Merknad: Dette skjemaet bruker en XSRF-forebygging (Cross-Site Request Forgery) cookie for å sikre sikkerhet. Denne cookie er strengt nødvendig og samler ikke inn personlig informasjon fra deg.\\\",\\\"<p>To initiate the identity verification process or track your request, please use the link we have just sent to your email. You can also verify your identity by clicking <a class=\\\\\\\"dsr-link\\\\\\\" id=\\\\\\\"idVerifyLink\\\\\\\">here</a>.</p>\\\":\\\"<p>For å starte identitetsbekreftelsesprosessen eller spore forespørselen din, vennligst bruk lenken vi nettopp har sendt til e-posten din. Du kan også bekrefte identiteten din ved å klikke <a class=\\\\\\\"dsr-link\\\\\\\" id=\\\\\\\"idVerifyLink\\\\\\\">her</a>.</p>\\\",\\\"<p>To initiate the identity verification process or track your request, please login <a class=\\\\\\\"dsr-link\\\\\\\" id=\\\\\\\"loginLink\\\\\\\">here</a>. You can also verify your identity by clicking <a class=\\\\\\\"dsr-link\\\\\\\" id=\\\\\\\"idVerifyLink\\\\\\\">here</a>.</p>\\\":\\\"<p>For å starte identitetsbekreftelsesprosessen eller spore forespørselen din, vennligst logg inn <a class=\\\\\\\"dsr-link\\\\\\\" id=\\\\\\\"loginLink\\\\\\\">her</a>. Du kan også bekrefte identiteten din ved å klikke <a class=\\\\\\\"dsr-link\\\\\\\" id=\\\\\\\"idVerifyLink\\\\\\\">her</a>.</p>\\\",\\\"Thank you for your request. We see that you have already submitted a similar request that we are currently processing. We ask that you await our response regarding the other request before pursuing this request. If this request refers to another topic please let us know. Please do not hesitate to contact us if you have any further questions.\\\":\\\"Takk for forespørselen din. Vi ser at du allerede har sendt inn en lignende forespørsel som vi behandler for øyeblikket. Vi ber deg avvente vårt svar angående den andre forespørselen før du forfølger denne forespørselen. Gi oss beskjed hvis denne forespørselen refererer til et annet emne. Ikke nøl med å kontakte oss hvis du har ytterligere spørsmål.\\\",\\\"By sending this request I confirm the following: I am entitled to make this request because it relates to the processing of my personal data or because I have been authorized by the data subject to whose data the request relates. The data contained in my request are accurate and correct. I am aware that the request, including the data contained therein, will be processed in order to respond to my request.\\\":\\\"Ved å sende denne forespørselen bekrefter jeg følgende: Jeg har rett til å komme med denne forespørselen fordi den er relatert til behandlingen av personopplysningene mine eller fordi jeg er autorisert av den registrerte hvis data forespørselen gjelder. Dataene i forespørselen min er korrekte. Jeg er klar over at forespørselen, inkludert dataene der, vil bli behandlet for å svare på forespørselen min.\\\"},\\\"pt-BR\\\":{\\\"Age\\\":\\\"Idade\\\",\\\"CVV\\\":\\\"Código de Verificação do Cartão\\\",\\\"DNI\\\":\\\"Documento nacional de identidade\\\",\\\"PIN\\\":\\\"Número de identificação pessoal\\\",\\\"VIN\\\":\\\"Número de identificação do veículo\\\",\\\"City\\\":\\\"Cidade\\\",\\\"HTML\\\":\\\"HTML\\\",\\\"IBAN\\\":\\\"Número de conta bancária internacional\\\",\\\"Port\\\":\\\"Portabilidade\\\",\\\"Race\\\":\\\"Raça\\\",\\\"test\\\":\\\"teste\\\",\\\"AT ID\\\":\\\"Bilhete de Identidade Austríaco\\\",\\\