uga dapat memverifikasi identitas Anda dengan mengklik <a class=\\\\\\\"dsr-link\\\\\\\" id=\\\\\\\"idVerifyLink\\\\\\\">kemari</a>.</p>\\\",\\\"<p>To initiate the identity verification process or track your request, please login <a class=\\\\\\\"dsr-link\\\\\\\" id=\\\\\\\"loginLink\\\\\\\">here</a>. You can also verify your identity by clicking <a class=\\\\\\\"dsr-link\\\\\\\" id=\\\\\\\"idVerifyLink\\\\\\\">here</a>.</p>\\\":\\\"<p>Untuk memulai proses verifikasi identitas atau melacak permintaan Anda, silakan login <a class=\\\\\\\"dsr-link\\\\\\\" id=\\\\\\\"loginLink\\\\\\\">kemari</a>. Anda juga dapat memverifikasi identitas Anda dengan mengklik <a class=\\\\\\\"dsr-link\\\\\\\" id=\\\\\\\"idVerifyLink\\\\\\\">kemari</a>.</p>\\\",\\\"Thank you for your request. We see that you have already submitted a similar request that we are currently processing. We ask that you await our response regarding the other request before pursuing this request. If this request refers to another topic please let us know. Please do not hesitate to contact us if you have any further questions.\\\":\\\"Terima kasih atas permintaan Anda. Kami melihat bahwa Anda telah mengirimkan permintaan serupa yang sedang kami proses saat ini. Kami meminta Anda menunggu tanggapan kami mengenai permintaan lain sebelum melanjutkan permintaan ini. Jika permintaan ini mengacu pada topik lain, beri tahu kami. Jangan ragu untuk menghubungi kami jika Anda memiliki pertanyaan lebih lanjut.\\\",\\\"By sending this request I confirm the following: I am entitled to make this request because it relates to the processing of my personal data or because I have been authorized by the data subject to whose data the request relates. The data contained in my request are accurate and correct. I am aware that the request, including the data contained therein, will be processed in order to respond to my request.\\\":\\\"Dengan mengirimkan permintaan ini, saya mengkonfirmasi hal berikut: Saya berhak untuk mengajukan pe