            "description": "## Request body parameters\n\n| Parameter | Type | Description | Example |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `label` | string | Specify your request type label. The character limit for label is 100 | `Information about Consent Denial` |\n| `value` | string | Specify the request type value. The character limit for value is 100. The value must be unique. Only lower case letters and hyphens are allowed. Once the value is set, you cannot change. | `info-about-consent-denial` |\n| `description` | string | Specify the description. The description hase a character limit of 500. | `Consent denial refers to a user's ability to refuse or withdraw consent for the processing of their personal data` |\n| `automation_enabled` | boolean | Specify the value for automation-enabled. This value can be `true` or `false`. | `true` |\n| `task_per_ds` | boolean | Specify the value for task_per_ds. This value can be `true` or `false`. | `true` |\n| `added_instructions.title` | string | Specify the title of subtask instruction to be added to a custom request type. The title can contain up to 100 characters. | `Upload a document` |\n| `added_instructions.description` | string | Specify the description of the custom subtask instruction. The description can contain up to 5000 characters. | `   Upload all information you fetched manually from the data system   ` |\n| `added_instructions.system_types` | array of strings | Specify the system type associated with the custom instruction. You must specify atleast one. It can have the following values: `unmonitored`, `user-defined`, `monitored-hybrid`, `monitored-unstructured`, `monitored-scanless-structured` | `[\"unmonitored\", \"user-defined\", \"monitored-hybrid\", \"monitored-unstructured\", \"monitored-scanless-structured\"]` |\n| `added_instructions.actions` | array of objects | List of actions for the custom subtask instruction. Each action contains `type`, `is_enabled`, and `is_mandatory`. | `[{\"type\": \"attachment\", \"is_enabled\": true, \"is_mandatory\": true}, {\"type\": \"notes\", \"is_enabled\": false, \"is_mandatory\": false}, {\"type\": \"mark_as_done\", \"is_enabled\": false, \"is_mandatory\": false}]` |\n| `added_instructions.actions.type` | string | Specify the type of action. The action type can have the following values: `attachment`, `notes`, `mark_as_done` | `attachment` |\n| `added_instructions.actions.is_enabled` | boolean | Specify the value as true or false. | `true` |\n| `added_instructions.actions.is_mandatory` | boolean | Specify the value as true or false | `true` |\n| `added_instructions.is_active` | boolean | Specify the value as true or false. | `true` |"
