            "description": "## Request body parameters\n\n| Parameter | Type | Description | Example |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `name` | string | Specify the name of the task template. The maximum character limit is 255 | `CCPA Access Handling` |\n| `description` | string | Specify the description for the task template. | `Processes deletion requests, including validation and confirmation before removal of personal data.` |\n| `org_unit_id` | integer | Specify the organization unit ID. | `1` |\n| `exclude_from_report` | boolean | Specify whether to exclude this task template from the final DSR report. Specify the value as true or false. | `true` |\n| `associate_data_systems` | boolean | Specify the value as `true` or `false`. | `true` |\n| `all_systems_included` | boolean | Specify the value as true or false. You cannot set this to true if `associate_data_systems` is false. | `false` |\n| `enable_dsr_robotic_automation` | boolean | Specify the value as true or false. | `true` |\n| `assign_subtasks_to_system_owners_collaborators` | boolean | Specify the value as true or false. | `true` |\n| `use_custom_subtask_instructions` | boolean | Specify whether to append or override request type instructions. | `true` |\n| `subtask_instruction_mode` | string | Specify the value as override or append. | `override` |\n| `mode` | string | Specify the value as `include` or `exclude`. | `exclude` |\n| `data_systems` | array of integers | Specify the Data system's ID. | `[100, 200]` |\n| `delay_task_creation` | boolean | Specify the value as true or false to enable or disable delayed task creation. | `false` |\n| `delay_duration` | integer | Specify the delay duration value. | `12` |\n| `delay_duration_mode` | string | Specify the delay duration mode (e.g., `d` for days). | `d` |\n| `delayed_data_sources` | string | Specify the data sources for which task creation should be delayed. | `34` |\n| `added_subtask_templates` | array | Specify the list of subtask templates to be added. | `[]` |\n| `updated_subtask_templates` | array of objects | Specify the list of subtask templates to be updated. | See examples below |\n| `updated_subtask_templates.name` | string | Specify the name of the subtask template. | `Search for Personal Data` |\n| `updated_subtask_templates.description` | string | Specify the description for the subtask template. | `Queries associated data systems to retrieve relevant personal data.` |\n| `updated_subtask_templates.assignees` | array of integers | Specify the assignee IDs for the subtask template. | `[331, 332]` |\n| `updated_subtask_templates.collaborators` | string | Specify the collaborator email addresses, separated by commas. | `omar.hassan@gmail.com,priya.patel@gmail.com` |\n| `updated_subtask_templates.collab_guidance` | string | Specify the guidance text for collaborators. | `Please review and complete the subtask as per the instructions provided.` |\n| `updated_subtask_templates.collab_email_subject` | string | Specify the email subject sent to collaborators. | `A new subtask assigned` |\n| `updated_subtask_templates.collab_email_template` | string | Specify the email body template sent to collaborators. | `You have been assigned multiple subtasks that need to be completed within 10 days.` |\n| `updated_subtask_templates.can_customise_email_and_guidance_text` | boolean | Specify whether collaborators can customize the email and guidance text. Specify the value as true or false. | `true` |\n| `updated_subtask_templates.deadline_days` | integer | Specify the number of days to set as the deadline. | `8` |\n| `updated_subtask_templates.deadline_type` | string | Specify the deadline type (e.g., `set_deadline`). | `set_deadline` |\n| `updated_subtask_templates.use_sub_task_template_name_for_subtask` | boolean | Specify whether to use the subtask template name for the subtask. Specify the value as true or false. | `true` |\n| `updated_subtask_templates.id` | integer | Specify the ID of the subtask template to be updated. | `123` |\n| `updated_instructions` | array of objects | Specify the list of instructions to be updated. | See examples below |\n| `updated_instructions.id` | integer | Specify the ID of the instruction to be updated. | `284` |\n| `updated_instructions.title` | string | Specify the title of the instruction. | `Upload a document` |\n| `updated_instructions.description` | string | Specify the description of the instruction. | `   Upload all information you fetched manually from the data system   ` |\n| `updated_instructions.system_types` | array of strings | Specify the system type associated with the instruction. It can have the following values: `unmonitored`, `user-defined`, `monitored-hybrid`, `monitored-unstructured`, `monitored-scanless-structured`. | `[\"unmonitored\", \"user-defined\", \"monitored-hybrid\"]` |\n| `updated_instructions.is_active` | boolean | Specify the value as true or false. | `true` |\n| `updated_instructions.actions` | array of objects | Specify the list of actions associated with the instruction. | `[{\"type\": \"attachment\", \"is_enabled\": true, \"is_mandatory\": true}]` |\n| `updated_instructions.actions.type` | string | Specify the type of action. The action type can have the following values: `attachment`, `notes`, `mark_as_done`. | `attachment` |\n| `updated_instructions.actions.is_enabled` | boolean | Specify the value as true or false. | `true` |\n| `updated_instructions.actions.is_mandatory` | boolean | Specify the value as true or false. | `true` |\n| `deleted_subtask_templates` | array of integers | Specify the list of subtask template IDs to be deleted. | `[130]` |\n| `deleted_instructions` | array of integers | Specify the list of instruction IDs to be deleted. | `[286, 287]` |"
