              "raw": "{\n    \"publish_subject\": \"Access Request Completed\",\n    \"publish_body\": \"<p>(<strong>Clone And Edit Before Use</strong>)</p><p>Hi {{.DataSubject}},</p><p>Thank you for your request. </p><p>We can provide you with the following information on the processing of your personal data:</p><p> We process your personal data for the following purposes: </p><p>(processing purposes) </p><p>We process the following categories of your personal data in: </p><p>(data categories processed)</p><p> We disclose your personal data to the following recipients: </p><p>(name or categories of recipients)</p><p>(In case of non-EU recipients:) Where the recipients are located in a country outside the EU, the transfer is safeguarded by (information on the respective safeguards for these data transfers, e.g. Standard Contractual Clauses, consent, Binding Corporate Rules, adequacy decision). We will store your personal data for (specific time period). OR We will store your personal data for a time period determined by the following criteria:</p><p> (criteria) </p><p>(In case of data collection from third party sources:) We have collected your personal data from the following sources: </p><p>(sources) </p><p>(In case of data collection from third party sources:) We conduct automated-decision making by (information about the logic used and the consequences of this processing for the requestor). By law, you have the right to request us to rectify or erase your data, the right to request the restriction of processing of your personal data and the right to object to such processing. You also have the right to lodge a complaint with a supervisory authority. Please find attached a copy of your personal data that we hold. </p><p>Please do not hesitate to contact us if you have any further questions. </p><p>With kind regards</p><p>{{.TenantName}}</p>\",\n    \"consolidated_report\": true,\n    \"include_system_names\": true,\n    \"include_pd_names\": true,\n    \"include_