g></p><p><strong>Submitted: {{ .RequestSubmissionDate }}</strong></p><p>Message content is as follows: <p>{{ .Message }}</p></p><p>Please access the messages by clicking here.</p><a rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\" href=\\\"{{.PortalLink}}\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">View Messages</a><p>Please do not hesitate to contact us if you have any further questions.</p><p>With kind regards</p><p>{{.TenantName}}</p>\",\n            \"used_for\": \"dsr.message_notification_mail\",\n            \"system\": true,\n            \"subject\": \"New message for the DSR Request\",\n            \"preview\": \"\",\n            \"module\": \"dsr\",\n            \"is_published\": true,\n            \"is_draft\": false,\n            \"published_at\": 1753078881576,\n            \"has_subject_bind_vars\": false,\n            \"locale\": \"en-us\",\n            \"require_translation\": false,\n            \"tenant_logo\": null,\n            \"logo_file_path\": \"\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"created_by\": 0,\n            \"modified_by\": 0,\n            \"created_at\": 0,\n            \"modified_at\": 1753078880137,\n            \"tenant_id\": \"xxxx\",\n            \"id\": 43,\n            \"title\": \"Login Token Regeneration\",\n            \"description\": \"This email is sent by Securiti when a login token is regenerated for the Subject rights request\",\n            \"body\": \"<p>Hi {{.User}}, </p><p>As requested, here is a new login link for accessing the DSR request</p><p>Request ID: <strong>{{ .RequestID }}</strong></p><a rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\" href=\\\"{{.PortalLink}}\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">DSR Request Center</a><p>Please do not hesitate to contact us if you have any further questions.</p><p><strong>For security purposes, the above link will expire in {{ .ExpiryDays }} day(s).</strong></p><p>With kind regards</p><p>{{.TenantName}}</p>\",\n            \"used_for\": \"dsr.login_token_regeneration\",\n            \"system\": true,\n            \"subject\": \"Link to access Privacy Central\",\n            \"preview\": \"\",\n            \"module\": \"dsr\",\n            \"is_published\": true,\n            \"is_draft\": false,\n            \"published_at\": 1753078880137,\n            \"has_subject_bind_vars\": false,\n            \"locale\": \"en-us\",\n            \"require_translation\": false,\n            \"tenant_logo\": null,\n            \"logo_file_path\": \"\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"created_by\": 0,\n            \"modified_by\": 0,\n            \"created_at\": 1737710962096,\n            \"modified_at\": 1753078877317,\n            \"tenant_id\": \"xxxx\",\n            \"id\": 105,\n            \"title\": \"DSR Email verification reminder\",\n            \"description\": \"Securiti sends this email to remind the dsp user to verify the identity\",\n            \"body\": \"<p>Dear {{.User}},</p><p>You recently made a Subject Rights Request ({{.DSRType}}) from {{.TenantName}}. Please verify that you made this request.</p>  <a href=\\\"{{.ConfirmEmailLink}}\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">Verify My email</a>\",\n            \"used_for\": \"dsr.dsp_user_email_verification_remainder\",\n            \"system\": true,\n            \"subject\": \"Verify your email to continue with your Subject Rights Request\",\n            \"preview\": \"\",\n            \"module\": \"dsr\",\n            \"is_published\": true,\n            \"is_draft\": false,\n            \"published_at\": 1753078877317,\n            \"has_subject_bind_vars\": true,\n            \"locale\": \"en-us\",\n            \"require_translation\": false,\n            \"tenant_logo\": null,\n            \"logo_file_path\": \"\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"created_by\": 0,\n            \"modified_by\": 0,\n            \"created_at\": 0,\n            \"modified_at\": 1753078875905,\n            \"tenant_id\": \"xxxx\",\n            \"id\": 46,\n            \"title\": \"Subject Rights Request Created Internally\",\n            \"description\": \"Securiti sends this email when an internal DSR is created on behalf of Data Subject.\",\n            \"body\": \"<p>Hi {{.User}}, </p><p>A subject rights request with ID: {{.RequestID}} has been created. You can view it by logging into the DSR Request Center. </p><a href=\\\"{{.PortalLink}}\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">DSR Request Center</a><br/><p>Trouble logging in? Please reset your password. </p><p>Please do not hesitate to contact us if you have any further questions.</p><p>With kind regards</p><p>{{.TenantName}}</p>\",\n            \"used_for\": \"dsr.create_request_via_portal_mail\",\n            \"system\": true,\n            \"subject\": \"Subject rights request created\",\n            \"preview\": \"\",\n            \"module\": \"dsr\",\n            \"is_published\": true,\n            \"is_draft\": false,\n            \"published_at\": 1753078875905,\n            \"has_subject_bind_vars\": false,\n            \"locale\": \"en-us\",\n            \"require_translation\": false,\n            \"tenant_logo\": null,\n            \"logo_file_path\": \"\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"created_by\": 0,\n            \"modified_by\": 0,\n            \"created_at\": 0,\n            \"modified_at\": 1753078874424,\n            \"tenant_id\": \"xxxx\",\n            \"id\": 47,\n            \"title\": \"Confirmation Email\",\n            \"description\": \"Securiti sends this email when it receives a new DSR request.\",\n            \"body\": \"<p>Hi {{.User}},</p><p>Thank you for submitting the following data subject rights requests:</p><p><strong>{{.RequestTypes}}</strong></p><p>In order to verify your identity we ask that you use the email verification link in this email. After confirming your identity we will process your inquiry promptly and respond within the legal time limits.</p><p><a href=\\\"{{.ConfirmEmailLink}}\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">Confirm Email</a></p><p>Please do not h