| `languages` | array of strings | Specify the language code. Fetch the language code from the response of Fetch all languages supported for DSR API. | `[\"en\", \"ar\", \"bs\", \"pt-br\"]` |\n| `default_language` | string | Specify the default language. Fetch the language code from the response of Fetch all languages supported for DSR API. | `en` |\n| `enable_language_intelligence` | boolean | Specify the value. You cannot set it to `true` when `language_selection` is set to `none`. | `true` |\n| `only_selected_countries` | boolean | Specify the value as true or false. If the value is `false` that means all countries are enabled on the published universal form. | `true` |\n| `countries` | array of strings | Specify the countries codes. The `code` in the response of Fetch the list of all countries represents country's code. | `[\"AFG\", \"ALB\", \"BRA\"]` |"
